&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;KnowBe4 empowers the modern workforce to make smarter security decisions every day. Trusted by more than 70,000 organizations worldwide, KnowBe4 is the pioneer of digital workforce security, securing both AI agents and humans. The KnowBe4 Platform provides attack simulation and training, collaboration security, and agent security powered by AIDA (Artificial Intelligence Defense Agents) and a proprietary Risk Score. The platform leverages 15-years of behavioral data to combat advanced threats including social engineering, prompt injection, and shadow AI. By securing humans and agents, KnowBe4 leads the industry in workforce trust and defense.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;To learn more about our team and office culture in Leeds, England (UK), visit the following links.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Glassdoor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Channel Sales is responsible for leading a team of Channel Sales representatives to drive sales efforts to meet and exceed Net New Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR) targets from a specified Area. This is an extremely hands-on role that will actively manage their teams who are responsible for building partnerships and growing Net New business through strong partnerships within a specified Area. The Director will align with the strategy for Channel Sales growth to execute strategic plans, grow pipeline and achieve revenue goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Manage a team of Channel Sales representatives to execute revenue strategies, and exceed KPIs and ARR targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the day-to-day activities of Channel Sales reps through daily team standups, close analysis of sales statistics and pipeline reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with partners directly to build strategic relationships and growth of key partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Channel Sales reps in building partner sales engagements and closing deals with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Develop, drive and guide our partner activities to foster excellent relationships with new and existing partners aligned to the partner stratification to grow net new revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Conduct weekly rhythm of the business reviews with VP and other sales enablement teams to identify trends and provide feedback on areas of opportunity and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
