&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with GTM Teams to Drive Commercial Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with your Account Manager and the wider account management team to ensure continuous alignment of account strategies and goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
