&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to make responsible innovation and delivery the default with an emphasis on efficiency, consistency and speed to value. We partner closely with our Sectors to help Baringa deliver Digital &amp;amp; AI solutions that are not only compliant, but trusted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
