&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the continuous iteration of key Responsible AI governance programme components (e.g., AI lifecycle and use case review processes, AI risk and impact assessments, training, policy/standards).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day legal advice on the design, build and delivery of Digital &amp;amp; AI products and solutions, including advising on AI and digital regulations, intellectual property, product terms and the data protection considerations that arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and pragmatic advice, to help enable Baringa’s commercial and strategic product and services strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the Legal Business Partner for Baringa’s Capabilities Sector (home to our experts in areas such as digital, data, AI, and business transformation) and collaborate with Baringa’s Technology team on Digital &amp;amp; AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the wider team to support operational AI and data governance matters, including AI use case triage and escalations, and AI and data incident response support (working with stakeholders in other teams).&lt;/li&gt;
