&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office). In this role, you’ll enable high-quality human-led decision-making to maximise impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Senior Data Scientists across different areas of the business. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope, remit and team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Analytics Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an outstanding analytics organisation, with a mission to enable the highest quality human and machine decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our community is highly active, with guest lectures, study groups, mentorship programmes and a robust technical review process. Data Scientists can progress equally as technical leads or people managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help answer questions like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which markets/cities should we enter next?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How can we incentivise good rider behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the impact of exclusive deals we have with restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we optimise our compensation policy to keep our customers happy and ordering with Deliveroo?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the trade-offs we face when choosing between growth and profitability? How should we decide between them?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How much should our pricing vary by distance and by market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the optimum selection and variety of restaurants in a particular area?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we adapt our consumer app to better suit grocery shoppers?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant experience in Data Science (or similar) roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading both simple and more complex experiment designs, with the ability to proactively unpick insights to steer strategic decision making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great communication skills - in person, in writing, in code; to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through solid analysis, provide clear and actionable recommendations that influence the team&#39;s roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving, demonstrating an ability to successfully address complex and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL. Proficiency with Cursor/AI tools to deliver impactful, high-quality work efficiently is also valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic, flexible approach, where you most care about achieving impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you&#39;ll be meeting with a range of both technical and non-technical stakeholders to translate business needs into data science problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;how we hire here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Account Executive (ENT) is responsible for driving complex, high-value enterprise deals and establishing long-term strategic partnerships with large customers. This role owns advanced, multi-stakeholder sales cycles that often span regions, business units, and decision layers. The ENT AE operates with a high degree of autonomy, shaping deal strategy, influencing executive stakeholders, and orchestrating cross-functional teams to deliver differentiated, value-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities as an&lt;strong&gt; Account Executive, Enterprise &lt;/strong&gt;include, but are not limited to the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Opportunity Ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and close high-value, complex enterprise opportunities, consistently meeting or exceeding individual quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strategic pipeline through self-prospecting, account planning, and SDR partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify whitespace, expansion potential, and multi-entity opportunities within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain forecasting, opportunity hygiene, and deal governance in Salesforce (SFDC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive-level discovery to understand enterprise supply chain strategy, risk posture, and long-term business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex buying groups across procurement, ops, finance, IT, and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design integrated, multi-product Flexport solutions aligned to customer priorities and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Flexport as a strategic partner through compelling value narratives, business cases, and solution roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deal Strategy, Negotiation &amp;amp; Closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end deal strategy for complex opportunities, including stakeholder mapping, decision criteria, and close plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead advanced commercial negotiation, pricing, contracts, and non-standard deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal stakeholders (Ops, Finance, Legal, Product) to progress deals efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onboarding, Expansion &amp;amp; Relationship Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the onboarding motion, ensuring enterprise customers are set up for scalable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain trusted relationships with senior and executive customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify expansion opportunities together with Account Management to drive sustained growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of escalation and strategic advisor during the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise Leadership &amp;amp; Market Impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior commercial voice in enterprise pursuits, sharing market insight and customer feedback internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to enterprise sales best practices, deal reviews, and peer coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Flexport with credibility and confidence in high-stakes customer interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience managing complex, enterprise-level sales cycles with consistent quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to close large, multi-stakeholder deals with long sales cycles and high deal complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence with the ability to influence senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced discovery, negotiation, and value-based selling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of autonomy, strategic thinking, and commercial judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong logistics, freight forwarding, or supply chain industry experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in there for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunches: Claim back up to GBP 15 per day for lunch allowance on office days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment, in addition to the usual bank holidays in England and Wales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers employees in UK private medical insurance including a dental care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan: Flexport offers employees in the UK a workplace pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
